  "text": "**Alex:** Hey, have you seen my keys? I swear I left them on the table.  \n**Jamie:** Did you check under the couch? Sometimes they slip behind there.  \n**Alex:** I checked everywhere. I even called my mom to see if she found them.  \n**Jamie:** Wait, you called your mom? That\u2019s new.  \n**Alex:** Yeah, I figured if I was missing them, maybe someone else might have found them.  \n**Jamie:** That\u2019s kind of\u2026 random.  \n**Alex:** I know, I know. I just wanted to be thorough.  \n**Jamie:** What\u2019s the big deal, anyway? You can just borrow mine.  \n**Alex:** No, no, no. I don\u2019t want to be a bother.  \n**Jamie:** Please. I\u2019ve got a spare pair. You can use them for like, ten minutes.  \n**Alex:** Are you serious?  \n**Jamie:** Yeah, I\u2019m not a robot. I can just leave them out for a bit.  \n**Alex:** Okay, okay. Thanks. I owe you one.  \n**Jamie:** No problem. Just don\u2019t lose them again.  \n**Alex:** I won\u2019t. I promise.  \n**Jamie:** Good. Now go get your keys.  \n**Alex:** Right now?  \n**Jamie:** Yeah, before you panic and start crying.  \n**Alex:** \u2026You\u2019re not funny.  \n**Jamie:** I know. But I\u2019m also helpful.  \n**Alex:** I guess. Thanks, Jamie.  \n**Jamie:** Anytime. Now go.",
